                                "sense_id": "0b4b8807-72ea-3ae4-9ec4-ef6dbcb49c48",
                                "text": "Thus like a Nun, not like a Princeſſe borne, / Deſcended from the Royall Henries loynes: / Liue I inuironed in a houſe of ſtone, […]"
                            },
                            {
